00:00:19.220 --> 00:00:20.300
I didn't translate...

00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:21.660
It did not translate to me.

00:00:21.660 --> 00:00:23.240
And I just thought "Was that...

00:00:23.240 --> 00:00:25.143
I know you're probably tired of this but-

00:00:25.143 --> 00:00:25.976
- [DeVaughn] No.

00:00:25.976 --> 00:00:27.633
- I have to ask 'cause she's Whitney.

00:00:27.633 --> 00:00:28.466
