00:00:28.466 --> 00:00:29.830
What was that like?
Do you remember?

00:00:29.830 --> 00:00:30.750
'Cause you were so little.

00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:32.990
- Yes I was so little.
It was mind blowing.

00:00:32.990 --> 00:00:35.430
But one of the things I
remember, I was eight.

00:00:35.430 --> 00:00:37.540
So I didn't even care
about Whitney Houston

00:00:37.540 --> 00:00:38.373
