00:00:38.373 --> 00:00:39.477
- [Kelly] That's what I'm saying-

00:00:39.477 --> 00:00:40.310
- Right.
Right.

00:00:40.310 --> 00:00:41.976
- [Kelly] That's why I
think it's so funny. Yeah.

00:00:41.976 --> 00:00:42.840
- That was the first
time I actually saw snow.

00:00:42.840 --> 00:00:45.930
So I was just like, "Oh
cool, this is great."

00:00:45.930 --> 00:00:47.185
And you know-

00:00:47.185 --> 00:00:48.283
- Whitney Houston's there like, "Snow!"

00:00:48.283 --> 00:00:49.116
- [DeVaughn] Yeah, yeah.

00:00:49.116 --> 00:00:49.949
Whitney Houston, Kevin Costner.

00:00:49.949 --> 00:00:50.782
- You're like Olaf. (laughs)

00:00:50.782 --> 00:00:51.615
- Yeah.
- I think it's amazing

00:00:51.615 --> 00:00:52.448
- Regardless.

00:00:52.448 --> 00:00:53.760
And I remember she took me
into her trailer one time

00:00:53.760 --> 00:00:55.050
