00:01:03.570 --> 00:01:04.690
I feel silly saying that.

00:01:04.690 --> 00:01:06.653
- No, she probably loved that.

00:01:06.653 --> 00:01:08.420
- [DeVaughn] Yeah. I think
it's so innocent and pure.

00:01:08.420 --> 00:01:09.990
And it was just such a huge...

00:01:09.990 --> 00:01:11.830
