00:04:12.392 --> 00:04:13.225
He told you he didn't...

00:04:13.225 --> 00:04:14.058
Oh and you're wearing a fur coat-

00:04:14.058 --> 00:04:14.891
- [DeVaughn] Yeah, yeah.

00:04:14.891 --> 00:04:16.251
He was like, "Man..."

00:04:16.251 --> 00:04:17.470
He was like "I'm from making Georgia,

00:04:17.470 --> 00:04:20.270
how am I gon' play
basketball in a fur coat?"

00:04:20.270 --> 00:04:21.160
(audience laughing)

00:04:21.160 --> 00:04:22.810
