00:04:24.068 --> 00:04:24.901
- I mean no.

00:04:24.901 --> 00:04:26.330
That was, that was their
decision so... (laughs)

00:04:26.330 --> 00:04:27.870
- He never wore a fur coat before?

00:04:27.870 --> 00:04:29.370
