00:04:29.370 --> 00:04:31.727
So our costume designer,
Emma Potter she was like,

00:04:31.727 --> 00:04:33.480
"Your dad says he never
wore a fur a coat?"

00:04:33.480 --> 00:04:35.810
She was like, "What's this?"

00:04:35.810 --> 00:04:38.118
I was like, "See?" (laughs)

00:04:38.118 --> 00:04:40.326
- She was like, "Skrr!" (laughs)

00:04:40.326 --> 00:04:41.159
I love that.

00:04:41.159 --> 00:04:41.992
- Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:04:41.992 --> 00:04:42.825
- I love that!

00:04:42.825 --> 00:04:45.922
- Yeah, oh here it is! Old
man is in a fur, you see It?

00:04:45.922 --> 00:04:46.755
- [Kelly] Lies and deception.

00:04:46.755 --> 00:04:47.900
- [DeVaughn] Yeah, lies and deception.

00:04:47.900 --> 00:04:49.759
- [Kelly] What happened
when you showed him that?

00:04:49.759 --> 00:04:51.058
- [DeVaughn] (gasps) He was like-

00:04:51.058 --> 00:04:51.891
